title: "The Triadic Measurement Substrate"
abstract: "A two-volume theoretical framework deriving physics, computation, and observation from a single confirmation primitive: three agents confirming one bit. Volume 1 develops the geometric and physical structure; Volume 2 extends the framework to agent-side structure, time, and questions of selfhood. Includes the complete LaTeX source, compiled PDF, and 53 deterministic Python verification scripts."
